{"id":"n21161-1-7","stage":3,"title":"불리다 · 泡","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21161-1-7-1","ko":"너는 목욕탕에 자주 가니?","zh":"你经常去浴场吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"목욕탕에","meaning":"公共浴室，澡堂","explanation":"목욕탕：公共浴室，澡堂；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"목욕탕","audio":"/audio/223fa6fe717158f9de26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55877","senseId":"1","lemma":"목욕탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목욕탕에","audio":"/audio/d1b84528a63091a6667c.mp3"}},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"가니?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가니","audio":"/audio/14b07c6dd4e5194ab610.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"223fa6fe717158f9","term":"목욕탕","zh":"公共浴室，澡堂","audio":"/audio/223fa6fe717158f9de26.mp3","entryId":"55877","definition":"供人洗澡用的设施或房间。","pronunciation":["모굑탕"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9f1947fdecabe6ab38f6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21161-1-7-2","ko":"응, 따뜻한 물에 때를 불렸다가 밀고 나면 기분이 좋아지거든.","zh":"嗯，用温水把污垢泡软后再擦掉，这样会让人感觉很舒服。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"따뜻한","meaning":"暖和","explanation":"따뜻하다：暖和；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"1","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따뜻한","audio":"/audio/69677f0d1e9358738e58.mp3"}},{"text":"물에","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물에","audio":"/audio/55b97eadc69b95f20fe5.mp3"}},{"text":"때를","meaning":"垢，污垢","explanation":"때：垢，污垢；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14423","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때를","audio":"/audio/4861537a8af6cb0a4d71.mp3"}},{"text":"불렸다가","meaning":"泡，泡胀","explanation":"불리다：泡，泡胀；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"불리다","audio":"/audio/aeb3b7a3d43d0e3d83e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21161","senseId":"1","lemma":"불리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불렸다가","audio":"/audio/110ce9cbd78e5e82eb8b.mp3"}},{"text":"밀고","meaning":"剃，搓，刨，刮","explanation":"밀다：剃，搓，刨，刮；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"밀다","audio":"/audio/2e251676952afc35931d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74177","senseId":"2","lemma":"밀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밀고","audio":"/audio/05f4d28907afeb5fd9c4.mp3"}},{"text":"나면","meaning":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","explanation":"나다：做完前面的动作（-고 나다）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나면","audio":"/audio/ee17327fab986ee28443.mp3"}},{"text":"기분이","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기분이","audio":"/audio/2c7d19f699b942f8cc0b.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아지거든.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아지거든","audio":"/audio/8f45fc417c18b6154a67.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"暖和","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"温度适中，不觉得太热，达到心情舒适的程度。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"垢，污垢","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"14423","definition":"沾在衣服或身上的脏灰尘，或皮肤废旧细胞和灰尘混合产生的东西。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"aeb3b7a3d43d0e3d","term":"불리다","zh":"泡，泡胀","audio":"/audio/aeb3b7a3d43d0e3d83e1.mp3","entryId":"21161","definition":"将某物浸在水中使其变大变软。","pronunciation":["불리다"]},{"id":"2e251676952afc35","term":"밀다","zh":"剃，搓，刨，刮","audio":"/audio/2e251676952afc35931d.mp3","entryId":"74177","definition":"涂擦地板或表面不整齐的部分。","pronunciation":["밀ː다"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62134","definition":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4341cb9287d8ffe739df.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.899,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=21161","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7257,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你经常去浴场吗？","嗯，用温水把污垢泡软后再擦掉，这样会让人感觉很舒服。","我今天要去买吸尘器。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你经常去浴场吗？","嗯，用温水把污垢泡软后再擦掉，这样会让人感觉很舒服。","我今天要去买吸尘器。"],"answer":1}]}
